  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#haymarket">Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market</placeName>.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, <date when="1811-05-31">Friday, May 31, 1811</date>,<lb/>
               Will be perform'd the Musical Piece, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_hunter_of_the_alps">Hunter of the Alps.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Felix,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Rosalvi,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cooper">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Jeronymo,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grove">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Florio,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_martin">Master <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Juho,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_c_carr">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">C. Carr</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Juan,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_paine">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Baptista,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_noble">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Marco,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Huntsmen,</role> Messrs. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_lewes"><hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi></actor> and <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hodson"><hi rend="allcaps">Hodson.</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>Chorus of Peasants, Dancers, &amp;c Messers. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_linton">Linton,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_eames">Eames,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_terry">Terry,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_griffith">Griffith,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_oddwell">Oddwell,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_willoughby">Willoughby,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_diether">Diether,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ca">Caulfield,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_harrison">Harrison,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_warner">Warner,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_sherrif">Sherrif,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#j_we">Wells,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hope">Hope,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_taylor">Taylor,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_widdicombe">Widdicombe,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cross">Cross,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_brown">Brown,</actor> &amp;c.<lb/>
                     Messdms. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_stokes">Stokes,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_kendall">Kendall,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_houghton">Houghton,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_danton">Danton,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_barrett">Barrett,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_taylor">Taylor,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_collingwood">Collingwood,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Helena,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Genevieve,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Bridemaids,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_watson">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_decamp">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which (Sixth Time) A Comick Piece in Two Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_trial_by_jury">Trial by Jury.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With <hi rend="allcaps">New Scenery, Dresses</hi>, &amp;c.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_barnes">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_r_jones">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_li">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>And <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added, The Musical Entertainment of The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_children_in_the_wood">Children in the Wood.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Walter,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lord Alford,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cooper">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sir Rowland,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ed_ey">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Apathy,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_noble">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Oliver,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_lewes">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Servant,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_widdicombe">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Gabriel,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_barnes">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Helen,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_msith">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Winifred,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grove">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Josephine,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_wheatley">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Wheatley</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Children,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_martin">Master <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi></actor> and <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_carr">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Carr</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi> <measure type="currency">5s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi> <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Second Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="18:00:00">Six o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="19:00:00">Seven</time>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mas">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi></persName> at the Theatre.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd that The New Comick Piece of The <hi rend="allcaps">Trial</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">By Jury</hi> which has been perform'd Five Nights successfully, can (in consequence of<lb/>
               the intended representation of other Popular Pieces, for the First Time this Season) only<lb/>
               be repeated on Three Evenings in the Ensuing Week.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
